  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiribati Australia Awards (in-country costs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this investment provides support for in-Kiribati implementation of the Kiribati Australia Awards Program. The new Investment follows on from INI614 - Kiribati Scholarships, completed on 30 June 2017. These funds provide support for the ongoing Australia Awards (AAS) and Australia Awards Pacific Scholarships (AAPS) and valued at $0.45 million over 3 years, starting 2017-18.</narrative>
  </description>
